ter a server restart the information comes back with the next poll. The decision is based on the difference of `Date.now()` values, not on the timer itself. Chrome can slow the timers of a background tab down to once a minute, so the decision may be up to about a minute late. The Idle Detection API is not used because it asks for permission and exists only in Chromium.
 
